  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" caput="38" para="true">TABVLA XXXIIX.</l>
    <l n="2" type="diagram" level="1">Naturales &amp; infitæ, quæ ex naturalibus potentiis proficiscuntur: &amp; sunt</l>
    <l n="3" type="diagram" level="1">Acquisitæ, seu habituales: vt est</l>
    <l n="4" type="diagram" level="2">Internæ</l>
    <l n="5" type="diagram" level="3">Intellectio, sub qua Recordatio</l>
    <l n="6" type="diagram" level="4">Simplicium apprehensio</l>
    <l n="7" type="diagram" level="4">Compositio &amp; divisio.</l>
    <l n="8" type="diagram" level="4">Discursus</l>
    <l n="9" type="diagram" level="5">Syllogisticus,</l>
    <l n="10" type="diagram" level="5">Methodicus.</l>
    <l n="11" type="diagram" level="3">Volitio</l>
    <l n="12" type="diagram" level="2">Externæ</l>
    <l n="13" type="diagram" level="3">Loquela,</l>
    <l n="14" type="diagram" level="3">Risus,</l>
    <l n="15" type="diagram" level="3">Fletus.</l>
    <l n="16" type="diagram" level="1">θεωρία, speculatio, contemplatio cæli &amp; aliarum rerum Physicarum, Mathematicarum.</l>
    <l n="17" type="diagram" level="1">πρᾶξις. Vide Tab.39.</l>
    <l n="18" type="diagram" level="1">ποίησις[?], quæ vel</l>
    <l n="19" type="diagram" level="2">Dignior, profecta scilicet ex dignioribus artibus, vt legere, scribere, perorare, disputare, curare ægros.</l>
    <l n="20" type="diagram" level="2">Indignior ex mechanicis: vt fabricare, texere, &amp;c.</l>
    <l n="21" type="heading" level="1" caput="39" para="true">TABVLA XXXIX.</l>
    <l n="22" type="diagram" level="1">Sacra, quæ vel</l>
    <l n="23" type="diagram" level="2">Communes: vt cultus &amp; invocatio Dei, dilectio proximi: &amp; aliæ operationes virtutum sanctarum.</l>
    <l n="24" type="diagram" level="2">Ecclesiasticæ, vt</l>
    <l n="25" type="diagram" level="3">Concionari,</l>
    <l n="26" type="diagram" level="3">Administrare sacramenta.</l>
    <l n="27" type="diagram" level="1">Ethicæ</l>
    <l n="28" type="diagram" level="2">Communes: vt Temperantiam, comitatem exercere; &amp; aliæ actiones virtutum Ethicarum.</l>
    <l n="29" type="diagram" level="2">Speciales</l>
    <l n="30" type="diagram" level="3">Politicæ: Regere Rempub. consilia dare.</l>
    <l n="31" type="diagram" level="3">Oeconomicæ</l>
    <l n="32" type="diagram" level="4">Administrare rem domesticam,</l>
    <l n="33" type="diagram" level="4">Educare liberos, &amp;c.</l>
    <l n="34" type="heading" level="1" caput="40" para="true">TABVLA XL.</l>
    <l n="35" type="diagram" level="1">Perfectiva creaturarum: &amp; vel in</l>
    <l n="36" type="diagram" level="2">Genere, seu communi: quæ vel</l>
    <l n="37" type="diagram" level="3">Ordinaria: vt</l>
    <l n="38" type="diagram" level="4">Gubernatio,</l>
    <l n="39" type="diagram" level="4">Sustentatio</l>
    <l n="40" type="diagram" level="3">Extraordinaria: cum res miraculose aliquid patiuntur: vt</l>
    <l n="41" type="diagram" level="4">Passiue.</l>
    <l n="42" type="diagram" level="2">Ignis inhibitionem calefactionis,</l>
    <l n="43" type="diagram" level="2">Sol inhibitionem sui motus.</l>
    <l n="44" type="diagram" level="2">Species</l>
    <l n="45" type="diagram" level="3">Spiritus</l>
    <l n="46" type="diagram" level="4">Angelorum bonorum; quibus item quædam sunt passiones: vt lætitia in Deo: ira in Deum &amp; electorum hostes, συμπάθεια erga homines.</l>
    <l n="47" type="diagram" level="4">Animarum piarum, quibus itidem insunt, lætitia &amp; eiusmodi aliæ passiones, quibus perficiuntur &amp; conseruantur.</l>
    <l n="48" type="diagram" level="3">Corporum</l>
    <l n="49" type="diagram" level="4">Superioris &amp; dignioris: vt cæli, in quo motus circularis est quædam passio.</l>
    <l n="50" type="diagram" level="4">Inferioris, &amp; vel in</l>
    <l n="51" type="diagram" level="5">Genere: vt alteratio, &amp; motus quiuis passiue acceptus.</l>
    <l n="52" type="diagram" level="5">Specie. Vide Tab.41.</l>
    <l n="53" type="diagram" level="1">Defectiua &amp; priuatiua. Vide Tab.44.</l>
    <l n="54" type="heading" level="1" caput="41" para="true">TABVLA XLI.</l>
    <l n="55" type="diagram" level="1">Elementorum, in quibus mutua alteratio.</l>
    <l n="56" type="diagram" level="1">Mixtorum: quæ vel</l>
    <l n="57" type="diagram" level="2">Communes: vt sunt</l>
    <l n="58" type="diagram" level="3">Calefieri, seu calefactio, passiue,</l>
    <l n="59" type="diagram" level="3">Frigefactio, Humefactio,</l>
    <l n="60" type="diagram" level="3">Siccatio,</l>
    <l n="61" type="diagram" level="3">Coctio, sub qua</l>
    <l n="62" type="diagram" level="4">Maturatio,</l>
    <l n="63" type="diagram" level="4">Elixatio,</l>
    <l n="64" type="diagram" level="4">Assatio.</l>
    <l n="65" type="diagram" level="2">Speciales</l>
    <l n="66" type="diagram" level="3">Animatorum, &amp; vel in</l>
    <l n="67" type="diagram" level="4">Genere: vt Nutritio, auctio.</l>
    <l n="68" type="diagram" level="4">Specie:</l>
    <l n="69" type="diagram" level="5">Plantarum: vt passiones arborum, herbarum.</l>
    <l n="70" type="diagram" level="5">Animalis, &amp; vel in</l>
    <l n="71" type="diagram" level="6">Genere:</l>
    <l n="72" type="diagram" level="7">Sensus, tam interni quam externi, quatenus in eis consideratur impressio speciei alicuius sensilis.</l>
    <l n="73" type="diagram" level="7">Appetitus. Vide Tab.42.</l>
    <l n="74" type="diagram" level="6">Specie:</l>
    <l n="75" type="diagram" level="7">Brutorum,</l>
    <l n="76" type="diagram" level="7">Hominis. Vide Tab.43.</l>
    <l n="77" type="diagram" level="3">Inanimatorum: vt passiones metallicæ &amp; minerales quibus perficiuntur.</l>
  </main_text>
